<title>USA: U.S. cash soymeal - Basis offers unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. cash soymeal - Basis offers unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rail and truck soymeal offers were mostly unchanged Monday, but shipments to domestic livestock feed markets continued steady, dealers said.</p>
<p>Most dealers said soymeal supplies are adequate for the demand, which is why basis levels were mostly unchanged and why CBOT March soymeal futures have traded in a narrow range since mid-January.</p>
<p>In southeast markets competively-priced cottonseed meal has slightly eroded demand for soymeal, but elsewhere soymeal demand remained strong, they said.</p>
